      "css": ".ds-btn-board{background:var(--board,oklch(0.43 0.105 158));color:var(--board-ink,oklch(0.975 0.012 158));border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 16px;font:600 0.9375rem/1.4 Archivo,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 120ms cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1),background-color 160ms cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)}.ds-btn-board:hover{background:var(--board-deep,oklch(0.355 0.09 158))}.ds-btn-board:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--amber,oklch(0.82 0.165 78));outline-offset:3px}.ds-btn-board:active{transform:translateY(1px) scale(0.975);transition-duration:60ms}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-btn-board:active{transform:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Card Button (on board)",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-card",
      "description": "Primary action set on green: off-white card, 48px, with a trailing arrow.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-board-swatch\"><button class=\"ds-btn-card\">Create account <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.25\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-board-swatch{background:var(--board,oklch(0.43 0.105 158));padding:20px;border-radius:16px}.ds-btn-card{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:48px;padding:0 20px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--card,oklch(0.985 0.002 158));color:var(--card-ink,oklch(0.17 0.012 158));font:600 1rem Archivo,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 1px 0 oklch(1 0 0/0.6) inset,0 6px 14px -6px oklch(0 0 0/0.45);cursor:pointer;transition:transform 120ms cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)}.ds-btn-card:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--amber,oklch(0.82 0.165 78));outline-offset:3px}.ds-btn-card:active{transform:translateY(1px) scale(0.975);transition-duration:60ms}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ink Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-ink",
      "description": "Secondary action on ground: Ink pill, 44px.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-ink\">Browse the shop</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-ink{height:44px;padding:0 20px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ink,oklch(0.2 0.016 158));color:var(--ground,oklch(0.975 0.004 158));font:600 0.9375rem Archivo,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 120ms cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1),opacity 160ms}.ds-btn-ink:hover{opacity:.9}.ds-btn-ink:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--amber,oklch(0.82 0.165 78));outline-offset:3px}.ds-btn-ink:active{transform:translateY(1px) scale(0.975)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Username Field (ground)",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input-ground",
      "description": "48px field with @ prefix; amber ring on focus and error.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-label\">Choose a username</label><div class=\"ds-field\"><span>@</span><input placeholder=\"mayon.blazers\"></div>",
      "css": ".ds-label{display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font:650 0.8125rem Archivo,sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 85;letter-spacing:.02em;color:var(--ink-2,oklch(0.42 0.018 158))}.ds-field{display:flex;align-items:center;height:48px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ground-2,oklch(0.948 0.007 158));color:var(--ink,oklch(0.2 0.016 158));box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line,oklch(0.87 0.01 158));transition:box-shadow 200ms}.ds-field span{color:var(--ink-2,oklch(0.42 0.018 158))}.ds-field input{flex:1;min-width:0;margin-left:2px;border:0;background:transparent;font:400 1.0625rem Archivo,sans-serif;color:inherit;outline:none}.ds-field:focus-within{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--amber,oklch(0.82 0.165 78))}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Translucent Nav",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav",
      "description": "Sticky 64px glass bar with blurred ground; solid under reduced transparency.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><span class=\"ds-nav-mark\">J&amp;J</span><a href=\"#\">Custom orders</a><a href=\"#\">AI studio</a><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-nav-cta\">Create account</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:64px;padding:0 24px;background:var(--nav-bg,oklch(0.975 0.004 158/0.72));-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(170%);backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(170%);font:400 0.9375rem Archivo,sans-serif}.ds-nav-mark{font-weight:800;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 62;color:var(--board-text,oklch(0.43 0.105 158));margin-right:16px}.ds-nav a{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--ink-2,oklch(0.42 0.018 158));text-decoration:none;transition:color 150ms}.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--ink,oklch(0.2 0.016 158))}.ds-nav a.ds-nav-cta{margin-left:auto;padding:8px 16px;background:var(--board,oklch(0.43 0.105 158));color:var(--board-ink,oklch(0.975 0.012 158));font-weight:600}.ds-nav a.ds-nav-cta:hover{background:var(--board-deep,oklch(0.355 0.09 158))}@media (prefers-reduced-transparency:reduce){.ds-nav{background:var(--ground,oklch(0.975 0.004 158));backdrop-filter:none;-webkit-backdrop-filter:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Split-Flap Readout",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "flap-cell",
      "description": "Off-white hinged cards in the Board voice inside a board well; blanks step back to 22%.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-board\"><div class=\"ds-well\"><span class=\"ds-flap\">R</span><span class=\"ds-flap\">E</span><span class=\"ds-flap\">A</span><span class=\"ds-flap\">D</span><span class=\"ds-flap\">Y</span><span class=\"ds-flap ds-blank\">&nbsp;</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-board{padding:24px;border-radius:1.75rem;color:var(--board-ink,oklch(0.975 0.012 158));background:radial-gradient(120% 80% at 50% -10%,oklch(1 0 0/0.07),transparent 60%),var(--board,oklch(0.43 0.105 158));box-shadow:0 1px 0 oklch(1 0 0/0.12) inset,0 30px 60px -30px oklch(0.25 0.08 158/0.55),0 12px 24px -12px oklch(0.25 0.06 158/0.35)}.ds-well{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:.06em;padding:16px 12px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--board-deep,oklch(0.355 0.09 158));box-shadow:inset 0 2px 6px oklch(0 0 0/0.28),0 1px 0 oklch(1 0 0/0.08);font:800 3.6rem/1 Archivo,sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 62;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:-.01em}.ds-flap{position:relative;display:inline-block;width:.72em;height:1em;line-height:1em;text-align:center;border-radius:.09em;color:var(--card-ink,oklch(0.17 0.012 158));background:linear-gradient(to bottom,var(--card,oklch(0.985 0.002 158)),var(--card-shade,oklch(0.93 0.004 158)) 50%,var(--card,oklch(0.985 0.002 158)) 50%)}.ds-flap::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:calc(50% - .5px);height:1px;background:oklch(0.2 0.02 158/0.35)}.ds-blank{opacity:.22}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Period Lamps",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "lamp-live",
      "description": "Idle, done, and live lamps in pill buttons on the board; live is the only amber.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-lamps\"><button class=\"ds-period\"><span class=\"ds-lamp ds-done\"></span>Design</button><button class=\"ds-period\"><span class=\"ds-lamp ds-live\"></span>Down payment</button><button class=\"ds-period\"><span class=\"ds-lamp\"></span>Production</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-lamps{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:16px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--board,oklch(0.43 0.105 158))}.ds-period{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 12px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:var(--board-ink,oklch(0.975 0.012 158));font:500 0.9375rem Archivo,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 120ms cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1),background-color 160ms}.ds-period:hover{background:oklch(0.355 0.09 158/0.7)}.ds-period:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--amber,oklch(0.82 0.165 78));outline-offset:3px}.ds-period:active{transform:translateY(1px) scale(0.975)}.ds-lamp{width:.7rem;height:.7rem;border-radius:999px;background:var(--board-edge,oklch(0.3 0.075 158));box-shadow:inset 0 1px 2px oklch(0 0 0/0.45);transition:background-color 220ms,box-shadow 220ms}.ds-done{background:var(--board-ink,oklch(0.975 0.012 158));box-shadow:0 0 0 1px oklch(1 0 0/0.2)}.ds-live{background:var(--amber,oklch(0.82 0.165 78));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px oklch(0.82 0.165 78/0.25),0 2px 6px oklch(0.82 0.165 78/0.45)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stock Size Rail",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "size-rail",
      "description": "Identical cells on a strip of board: lit in stock, amber low, blank well when sold out.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-rail\"><li class=\"ds-cell\"><small>S</small>12</li><li class=\"ds-cell\"><small>M</small>8</li><li class=\"ds-cell ds-low\"><small>L</small>2</li><li class=\"ds-cell ds-out\"><small>XL</small>–</li><li class=\"ds-cell\"><small>2XL</small>5</li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:6px;margin:0;padding:6px;list-style:none;border-radius:12px;background:var(--board,oklch(0.43 0.105 158));max-width:22rem}.ds-cell{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:56px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--card,oklch(0.985 0.002 158));color:var(--card-ink,oklch(0.17 0.012 158));box-shadow:0 1px 2px oklch(0 0 0/0.2);font:800 1.375rem/1.1 Archivo,sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 62;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;transition:background-color 260ms,color 260ms}.ds-cell small{font:650 .6875rem/1 Archivo,sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 85;opacity:.7}.ds-low{background:var(--amber,oklch(0.82 0.165 78));color:var(--amber-ink,oklch(0.28 0.06 65));box-shadow:none}.ds-out{background:var(--board-deep,oklch(0.355 0.09 158));color:var(--board-ink-2,oklch(0.85 0.045 158));box-shadow:inset 0 2px 4px oklch(0 0 0/0.3)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Liga Scoreboard",
    "overview": "Every custom order is a game in progress, kept on the hand-flipped scoreboard of a barangay covered court and rebuilt with Apple precision. The instrument surfaces are painted court-green boards; the readouts on them are true off-white split-flap cards carrying near-black condensed numerals; and one shot-clock amber is held back for the things that are happening right now. Everything around the board sits on a quiet neutral ground tinted toward the same green, so the board is always the loudest object in view.\n\nThe system is one family, Archivo, worked across its width axis: pulled to its narrowest for board numerals and display, kept at normal width for anything people read. Density follows the scoreboard: a strict cell module, identical cells in a run, ruled bands between readings, lamps for stage. Depth is physical and restrained (a lit, slightly convex board; recessed wells; cards that sit proud of the paint), and the only authored motion is the flip.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One saturated court green owns every instrument surface; the ground is near-neutral green-tinted paper.",
      "Off-white flip cards with a hinge line are the signature readout, never decoration.",
      "Amber means \"now\": live stage, low stock, focus, and a board-side error. Nothing else.",
      "Archivo only, differentiated by width (62 / 72 / 85 / normal), weight, and tabular figures.",
      "Light and dark are both first-class, switched by `prefers-color-scheme`.",
      "Every control has press travel; the flip is the single authored animation."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Amber-Is-Now Rule",
        "body": "Amber is for live and low: the stage in progress, a size about to run out, and the attention states that follow from them (keyboard focus, selection, an error on the board). It never fills a section, a headline, a button at rest, or an illustration chrome. If nothing is live or low, a screen should show no amber at all.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Green Rule",
        "body": "One saturated green owns the instrument surfaces. Do not introduce a second brand hue; supporting surfaces are the green-tinted neutrals, and new states are expressed as card state (lit, amber, blank), not new colors.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Card Ink Rule",
        "body": "On amber use `amber-ink`; on cards use `card-ink`; on green use `board-ink` / `board-ink-2`. On light ground, an error hint is semibold `ink` rather than amber text, because amber text on light ground is illegible.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Width-Is-Voice Rule",
        "body": "Hierarchy is carried by the width axis and weight of one family, never by a second typeface. Board numerals are `wdth` 62, display is 72, labels 85, reading text normal width.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tabular Board Rule",
        "body": "Every number that can change (counts, percentages, dates, timestamps, order numbers) is set in tabular figures so the board never reflows.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Only-The-Board-Lifts Rule",
        "body": "The large drop shadow belongs to the scoreboard. Other surfaces are flat with a hairline, or recessed as wells.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Flip Rule",
        "body": "The flip is the single authored motion: the top flap falls (170ms, `--ease-in` `cubic-bezier(0.55, 0, 1, 0.45)`, rotateX 0 to -90deg, dimming to 82%), then the bottom flap rises (230ms, `--ease-out` `cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)`), staggered 28ms per cell. It is interruptible: a new value always starts from the card on screen. The board auto-advances (2.6s) only while at least 35% visible and the tab is visible, and stops for good after a manual tap. Everything else is state transition only (press travel, lamp, cell, nav fade, jersey color cross-fade at 480ms).",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** put live data on the board in flip cells with tabular figures and a fixed cell count.",
      "**Do** express inventory state as card state: lit, amber for low, blank for sold out.",
      "**Do** keep amber for live and low (plus focus, selection, and board-side error) only.",
      "**Do** separate the voices with Archivo's width axis: 62 board, 72 display, 85 label, normal for reading.",
      "**Do** give every control press travel and the global amber focus ring.",
      "**Do** ship light and dark together; check `board-text` and card values in both.",
      "**Do** honor reduced motion by swapping cards in place, and reduced transparency with a solid nav."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** use amber as a brand fill, a button color at rest, or decoration.",
      "**Don't** add a second typeface or a second brand hue.",
      "**Don't** animate anything else with an authored entrance, scroll reveal, or loop; the flip is the motion.",
      "**Don't** put the board lift shadow on anything but the scoreboard.",
      "**Don't** set amber text on light ground; use semibold ink.",
      "**Don't** let a readout reflow when its value changes."
    ]
  }
}